ities & Amenities','description' => 'Easy access to a complete range of public amenities and facilities.','image' => 'assets/pahsb/media/bc7f9495-puncak-alam-public-schools.jpg'],['title' => 'UiTM Puncak Alam Campus','description' => 'Modern with appropriate environment to foster teaching, learning and research.','image' => 'assets/pahsb/media/0da8552d-800x480uitm-a-400x225.jpg'],['title' => 'Taman Tasik Puncak Alam','description' => 'Great recreational park for you and your family.','image' => 'assets/pahsb/media/d2767b09-puncak_alam_slide_c.jpg'],['title' => 'Bandar Puncak Alam Residentials','description' => 'Escape the bustling city life and enjoy calm environment of Puncak Alam!','image' => 'assets/pahsb/media/f283245e-bandar-puncak-alam-residentials.jpg']],'source' => 'https://puncakalam.my/','extractedAt' => '2026-11-12T06:43:40.261Z'];
